1
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:12,953
Bringing a product from a factory abroad to a customer in Brazil is a long relay.

2
00:00:13,074 --> 00:00:17,094
Suppliers, agencies, certifiers, freight, customs, carriers.

3
00:00:18,263 --> 00:00:21,793
Each one with its own e-mails, spreadsheets and chat groups.

4
00:00:21,913 --> 00:00:23,913
And nobody sees the whole picture.

5
00:00:25,083 --> 00:00:28,826
The Wellmix Portal puts the entire operation in one place.

6
00:00:28,946 --> 00:00:34,374
One workflow, shared by Wellmix, its suppliers, its service partners and its customers.

7
00:00:34,494 --> 00:00:36,720
Each login sees only its own part.

8
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:41,868
The portal follows the import from start to finish, in six blocks.

9
00:00:41,988 --> 00:00:46,605
Book: supplier price books, item selection, negotiation and samples.

10
00:00:46,725 --> 00:00:51,193
Order: the purchase order, artwork, certification and the signed contract.

11
00:00:51,313 --> 00:00:55,418
Production: follow-ups, inspection, loading and shipping documents.

12
00:00:55,538 --> 00:00:58,518
Delivery: customs, transport and receiving.

13
00:00:58,638 --> 00:01:02,221
Sales: offers, sales orders and the delivery schedule.

14
00:01:02,341 --> 00:01:07,470
And Finance: supplier payables, customer receivables, cash flow and commissions.

15
00:01:07,590 --> 00:01:10,693
Every step has an owner, a deadline and a status.

16
00:01:11,863 --> 00:01:16,459
The customer places an order and follows every stage without picking up the phone.

17
00:01:16,579 --> 00:01:20,521
The payment plan, instalments and bank slips are on the same screen.

18
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:23,887
On arrival, they confirm receipt and rate the purchase.

19
00:01:25,057 --> 00:01:29,077
The supplier works from a single task list, in Chinese or English.

20
00:01:29,197 --> 00:01:32,870
They answer requests with price, minimum order and lead time.

21
00:01:32,990 --> 00:01:37,949
They upload sample photos and videos, production dates and inspection evidence.

22
00:01:38,069 --> 00:01:40,654
And they see the payment forecast for every order.

23
00:01:41,824 --> 00:01:47,079
The art agency receives the factory's die cut and product photos in its workdesk.

24
00:01:47,199 --> 00:01:50,791
It uploads the artwork and gets feedback with a clear reason.

25
00:01:50,911 --> 00:01:54,419
Then it delivers the final art with the certification seal.

26
00:01:54,539 --> 00:02:02,847
Agency in Brazil, factory abroad: files and tasks flow through the portal, and each side chats with Wellmix. No e-mails.

27
00:02:04,017 --> 00:02:07,717
The certification body has one queue of certificates to issue.

28
00:02:07,837 --> 00:02:13,201
It reads the purchase sheet and uploads the technical description, the seal and the certificate.

29
00:02:14,371 --> 00:02:17,708
On the factory floor, the inspection is done from a phone.

30
00:02:17,828 --> 00:02:21,550
The supplier takes each photo, and the portal saves it at once.

31
00:02:21,670 --> 00:02:24,025
Then types the measured weight and taps send.

32
00:02:24,145 --> 00:02:27,489
On the other side, Wellmix sees every item on the order.

33
00:02:28,759 --> 00:02:33,270
At origin, the marketing agency confirms that the sample has arrived.

34
00:02:33,390 --> 00:02:38,151
It uploads real photos and videos of each product, and returns the sample.

35
00:02:39,321 --> 00:02:44,493
The freight forwarder registers the ocean booking and follows the container at origin.

36
00:02:44,613 --> 00:02:49,630
The shipping line answers freight requests, issues the BL and confirms the shipment.

37
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:57,508
In Brazil, the foreign trade advisory and the customs broker handle licences, documents and clearance.

38
00:02:57,628 --> 00:03:00,552
Every step shows who does it and who validates it.

39
00:03:01,722 --> 00:03:05,500
The carrier sees the cargo and the delivery address on one card.

40
00:03:05,620 --> 00:03:09,854
It updates the status on the road and confirms the delivery from a phone.

41
00:03:11,024 --> 00:03:14,937
Inside Wellmix, every function has its own screens and tasks.

42
00:03:15,057 --> 00:03:18,943
Buyers import supplier books, select items and negotiate.

43
00:03:19,063 --> 00:03:22,536
Product managers evaluate samples and keep the product sheet.

44
00:03:22,656 --> 00:03:25,829
Planners follow production dates, containers and freight.

45
00:03:25,949 --> 00:03:29,548
Registration validates tax codes and master data.

46
00:03:30,718 --> 00:03:34,544
Finance validates import costs and registers the invoice.

47
00:03:34,664 --> 00:03:39,132
Quality checks every container on arrival: seal, photos and count.

48
00:03:39,252 --> 00:03:43,485
Sales records offers, opens sales orders and schedules deliveries.

49
00:03:43,605 --> 00:03:47,197
Directors approve the purchase strategy and sign the contract.

50
00:03:47,317 --> 00:03:50,995
And the administrator controls access, deadlines and settings.

51
00:03:52,165 --> 00:03:54,980
All communication lives inside the portal.

52
00:03:55,100 --> 00:03:57,237
The scattered e-mail threads end here.

53
00:03:57,357 --> 00:04:02,103
Each company has one chat with Wellmix, organised by order and by item.

54
00:04:02,223 --> 00:04:06,496
Photos, videos and files stay attached to the subject they belong to.

55
00:04:06,616 --> 00:04:08,696
Nothing gets lost. No mess.

56
00:04:09,966 --> 00:04:14,989
A notification bell and a task inbox show each person what is waiting for them.

57
00:04:15,109 --> 00:04:17,135
And Wellmix sees who owes a reply.

58
00:04:18,304 --> 00:04:21,535
The portal speaks Portuguese, English and Chinese.

59
00:04:22,705 --> 00:04:24,537
Access is defined by role.

60
00:04:24,657 --> 00:04:27,781
Each partner sees its own orders, and nothing else.

61
00:04:27,901 --> 00:04:32,006
Customers never see the supplier, the purchase price or the margin.

62
00:04:33,176 --> 00:04:35,660
Quality is documented at every stage.

63
00:04:35,780 --> 00:04:38,360
Inspection with photos, weight and video.

64
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:42,146
Container loading with photos, seal and container number.

65
00:04:42,266 --> 00:04:45,578
Packing list, invoice and BL, checked line by line.

66
00:04:46,398 --> 00:04:50,439
For management, the Control Tower shows the whole process by stage.

67
00:04:50,559 --> 00:04:55,695
The SLA panel shows what is overdue, what is due today and who is responsible.

68
00:04:55,815 --> 00:04:58,862
Dashboards and a full audit trail complete the picture.

69
00:04:59,732 --> 00:05:03,261
It works on any screen, and installs like an app on a phone.

70
00:05:03,381 --> 00:05:06,331
And it is built to work with Wellmix's ERP.

71
00:05:07,101 --> 00:05:10,450
One portal. Every partner. Every step of the journey.

72
00:05:10,570 --> 00:05:12,968
Wellmix. Imports from order to delivery.
